{'symbol': 'CMCSA', 'date': '2022-12-21 07:00:00', 'title': "PEPPER CONSUMER IOT PLATFORM AND NOTION, COMCAST'S INSURTECH BUSINESS UNIT, COMBINE TO CREATE A LEADING IOT PLATFORM COMPANY", 'text': 'KANSAS CITY, MO. & DENVER--( BUSINESS WIRE )--PEPPER AND NOTION ANNOUNCED TODAY THEY HAVE COMBINED, CREATING A LEADING IOT AND SMART HOME PLATFORM BUSINESS THAT WILL OFFER INSURANCE CARRIERS CUSTOMIZED, SEAMLESS AND CONNECTED SOLUTIONS IN THE FAST GROWING INSURTECH AND IOT INDUSTRIES. PEPPER ENABLES BUSINESSES WORLDWIDE TO BUILD, DELIVER AND MONETIZE SECURE CONNECTED DEVICES AND SERVICES TO CONSUMERS THROUGH A SUSTAINABLE REVENUE MODEL. NOTION IS AN EASY-TO-USE DIY SMART PROPERTY MONITORING SENSOR SYSTEM AND APP TO ENABLE HOME AND SMALL BUSINESS OWNERS TO PROACTIVELY MONITOR AND REDUCE LOSS FROM COSTLY PROPERTY DAMAGES. COMCAST, THE PREVIOUS OWNER OF NOTION, HAS MADE AN INVESTMENT IN THE PEPPER/NOTION COMBINATION.'}